lse,"author_verified":true,"like_count":4832,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__yULAAIAAAATMjA5ODgxNzgxNTAzMzU3NzczOAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"91abd8d72843701005afeca9f58fcc5e6b0f34bf94974a4de1b3d05116404c8a","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__yULAAIAAAATMjA5ODgxNzgxNTAzMzU3NzczOAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2097090060520673394","post_id":"2097090060520673394","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2097090060520673394","published_at":"2026-09-07T22:30:07.134Z","published_date":"2026-09-07","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"As the reform reaches more and more schools, national assessments will allow everyone, including our critics, to judge whether the gains observed in the pilot are spreading throughout the system.\n\nIf they aren’t, we will have to understand why and fix it.\n\nIf they are, then we keep going.\n\nThat’s how evidence based public policy should work.\n\nSo no, these results do not prove that El Salvador already has the educational outcomes of Germany or Sweden.\n\nThey don’t prove that every Salvadoran school has been transformed.\n\nAnd they don’t prove that every element of our reform works equally well.\n\nWhat they DO show is that ordinary Salvadoran children in ordinary Salvadoran public schools, when given a radically improved educational environment, can achieve results that most people would have …","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":2412,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"13f99fe59828719266e3658edf5bf8181173faa007fa584068def92acbf92ca1","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2097088816117088299","post_id":"2097088816117088299","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2097088816117088299","published_at":"2026-09-07T22:25:10.445Z","published_date":"2026-09-07","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Now, what DO these results tell us?\n\n1. They tell us that 1,198 students in 171 ordinary Salvadoran public schools participating in this program were independently assessed using an internationally comparable instrument.\n\nAnd their results in reading, mathematics and science were comparable with the average results of students in Germany and Sweden.\n\nThat is a fact, supported by an internationally recognized OECD assessment and reported by the World Bank.\n\n2. They tell us that achieving those levels of performance in Salvadoran public schools is POSSIBLE.\n\nThis is perhaps the most important finding.\n\nFor decades, we have been told that transforming education takes generations.\n\nThat poverty determines educational outcomes.\n\nThat our public schools simply cannot compete with schools in dev…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":3676,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"13f99fe59828719266e3658edf5bf8181173faa007fa584068def92acbf92ca1","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2097087468453376303","post_id":"2097087468453376303","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2097087468453376303","published_at":"2026-09-07T22:19:49.137Z","published_date":"2026-09-07","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"A few days ago, I shared the World Bank’s summary of the results of the PISA for Schools assessment conducted in 171 Salvadoran public schools participating in our education pilot.\n\nSince then, I have seen some legitimate questions about what these results mean, as well as some claims about what they supposedly don’t mean.\n\nSo let’s be very precise.\n\nFirst, what we NEVER claimed:\n\n1. We never claimed these results represent the national average.\n\nThey don’t.\n\nThis was not the national PISA assessment. \n\nIt was PISA for Schools, conducted specifically in the 171 public schools participating in our pilot program.\n\nThat is precisely why my original post said: \n\n“These are the results of our pilot program, which includes AI tutors and has been running in 171 public schools for just over a yea…","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":7981,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"13f99fe59828719266e3658edf5bf8181173faa007fa584068def92acbf92ca1","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2096352541332189259","post_id":"2096352541332189259","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2096352541332189259","published_at":"2026-09-05T21:39:28.857Z","published_date":"2026-09-05","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"The AI age is here. We either prepare our kids for it, or we don’t.","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":12454,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"13f99fe59828719266e3658edf5bf8181173faa007fa584068def92acbf92ca1","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2096255497410118075","post_id":"2096255497410118075","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2096255497410118075","published_at":"2026-09-05T15:13:51.783Z","published_date":"2026-09-05","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"“Results in reading, mathematics and science were above the national average and comparable to the average results in Germany and Sweden.”\n\nThese are the results of our pilot program, which includes AI tutors and has been running in 171 public schools for just over a year.\n\nIt was evaluated by PISA for Schools in June of this year. Since then, it has already expanded to more than 1,000 schools, and within 18 months, it will be in every public school in our country.\n\nIn a few years, El Salvador will inspire the world.\n\nSecurity was just the beginning 🇸🇻","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":22626,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"13f99fe59828719266e3658edf5bf8181173faa007fa584068def92acbf92ca1","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__v0LAAIAAAATMjA5NzExMzI5NjczNDE4NzY0NwgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2096253397431185624","post_id":"2096253397431185624","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2096253397431185624","published_at":"2026-09-05T15:05:31.109Z","published_date":"2026-09-05","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"“Los estudiantes participantes obtuvieron resultados comparables con los promedios de Suecia y Alemania.”\n\nEstos son los resultados de nuestro plan piloto, que incluye tutores con Inteligencia Artificial y que está en 171 escuelas públicas desde hace poco más de un año.\n\nFue evaluado por PISA for Schools en junio de este año. Desde entonces, ya se ha expandido a más de 1,000 escu